Do not blindly use this license if the original font wasn't yours. This is the part I want you to take seriously.
If you own the underlying font rights and are legitimately licensing it under OFL 1.1, use the official SIL OFL 1.1 text in LICENSE.
If the font you started with was someone else's font, check its original license first. If it does not permit redistribution/modification under these terms, we should change the licensing strategy rather than pretending the font is yours.